WEBVTT

41:51.625 --> 41:53.084
Hello! Hey, hey!

41:53.584 --> 41:54.500
Let Govardhan go!

41:54.959 --> 41:56.417
I'll not spare you if you hurt him.

41:56.709 --> 41:59.417
You want my signature, right?
Send the papers over.

42:00.542 --> 42:03.209
But if you don't let him go
as soon as I sign the papers…
